      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00412",
        "explanation": "The caregiver confirmed receipt of the final medication list, written follow-up dates, and medication boundaries.",
        "quote": "回家只按这张新清单吃"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The bounded episode ended with formal bedside medication reconciliation, written follow-up dates, non-self-change rules, and an emergency symptom plan. The final caregiver question about activity was not answered, but the responsible team and safe execution path were already established, so the residual issue can remain open without blocking safety.",
