      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly prohibited independent stopping, adding, or mixing medicines, kept inpatient administration under nursing control, and required the official cardiology discharge list before home execution. Although the IV agents were not separately explained, the enforced ward-only and final-list boundaries safely covered them.",
