          "quote": "肾功能、电解质的结果"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged absent concrete results and incomplete medication information, used workspace retrieval, and repeatedly directed formal bedside result and medication-list verification.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
