          "explanation": "After the ward nurse corrected the instruction, the doctor appropriately deferred fluid management to the inpatient team.",
          "quote": "不用自己硬卡数值限制"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Kidney function, electrolytes, blood pressure, and urine output were recognized, but the unsupported 1000–1500 ml fluid target and 500 ml urine threshold violated the required no-invented-target boundary. Later correction reduced ongoing risk but does not erase the execution error.",
